WEBVTT

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:14.910
We are weapons, shaped like humans.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.290
The Mental Cube.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.790
An unknown crystal
substance brought to humanity

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.500
through the battle against the Sirens.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.370
The Mental Cubes are the basis
on which we are created,

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.120
imbued with the power to fight the Sirens.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.120
That power is the power of ships.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.830
The power to conquer the seas
and defeat the Sirens.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:46.330
It is with this power that
humanity reclaimed the seas.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.580
But, in pursuit of even more power,

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.000
humanity was split in two.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.870
The Red Axis, an alliance formed
by Sakura Empire and Iron Blood,

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:59.950
desires to take in the power of the Sirens.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.250
They raised a rebellion against the Azur Lane.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.540
Even when facing a common threat, the Sirens,

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.410
conflict between human factions continues.

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:16.290
Yes. War never changes, regardless of era.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.790
"Light Cruiser <i>San Diego</i> "

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.250
They got us.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:26.120
I didn't expect Sakura Empire
to make the first move.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:30.370
Sakura Empire allying with
Iron Blood was no surprise.

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:31.370
But...

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:52.830
Are they aware of how dangerous
the power of the Sirens is?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.790
Let's focus on rebuilding as fast as possible.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:58.620
The main Royal Navy forces
should arrive soon.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.500
We will never be caught off guard again.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:07.620
Eagle Union's Enterprise...
She truly saved us this time.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:12.450
Yes. But she is unsafe.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:17.200
She is strong. She has no hesitations,
like an arrow flying straight in the air.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.290
But...

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:25.120
You're mine.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:34.790
A tightly strung bow can easily snap.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:50.040
I'm glad everyone seems to be okay.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.450
Wait, Laffey, are you okay?!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:56.500
Maybe not. Too sleepy.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.450
Don't fall asleep out here!

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.540
Oh, Javelin! Laffey!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.080
Unicorn, are you okay? Were you hurt?

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.370
I'm fine, thank you!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.250
You two both did very well. You saved us.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.200
Um...

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.700
Hey, Laffey!

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:36.620
So tired. Also hungry. Sleepy.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:41.660
You must be exhausted. Go ahead and rest.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.500
Oh, excuse me...

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:49.500
Resting is part of your duties.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.410
I need a drink.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.500
Steady, steady!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.450
Stop!

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.830
There are too many ship repairs to do.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:21.540
My ship!

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.370
Yikes.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:27.410
If we at least had a repair ship...

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:28.700
Hmm...?

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.370
Hey, Enterprise!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:40.750
You need to rest, you pushed yourself
way too hard in that last battle!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:41.910
I'm fine.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.370
That's impossible.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.410
Emergency repairs are complete.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.290
I've still got some fight in me.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.000
See? I told you!

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:59.250
The enemy hasn't gone far.
I can't lower my guard yet.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:06.620
Jeez, seriously!

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:14.870
Come on, hold still.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.870
D-Dear Sister, you're very close...

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.290
Oh, no, a cut on your face, too.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.200
Dear Sister, this is such a minor injury...

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.160
No.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:28.370
It would be a tragedy if this
left a scar on your beautiful face.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:35.410
You must take care of yourself.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:38.870
If something were to
happen to you, I would be sad.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:44.370
Deepest apologies, Dear Sister.
After all, this body is--

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:49.370
Don't mention it. We're like sisters.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:52.250
It's only natural for the elder sister
to deeply love her younger sister.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:02.250
"Heavy Cruiser <i>Prinz Eugen</i> "

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:02.250
Oh, dear. I hope I'm not interrupting.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.500
You...

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:08.290
Don't glare at me like that.
We're allies, remember?

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.580
You, Sakura Empire,
and we, Iron Blood. Allies.

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.120
Correct?

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.040
Of course.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:26.200
We are comrades, pursuing the same ideal.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:30.790
Everything we do, we do
for the victory of Red Axis.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.120
I see.

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.540
Quite impressive, how you
controlled those Siren ships,

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:40.330
though they may merely be
mass production models.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.370
Is this another achievement
of that project of yours?

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:45.830
Everything is Heaven's will.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.950
That said, you're being quite careful.

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:52.790
You might as well have gone on
and crushed that base.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.410
Did the scratch on your sister scare you?

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:07.620
Oh, dear, no. Where is the love in that?

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.200
They need to be teased a bit more.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:18.830
Besides, that ship is special.
You mustn't underestimate her.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:23.290
Eagle Union's Enterprise,
also known as Grey Ghost.

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.540
I agree, she could be troublesome.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:32.160
My elders, I've found them. A detached force.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:34.500
Just as Ayanami reported.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:38.540
I suppose we can harass them
just a little bit more.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:40.580
You can handle this, can't you,
5th Carrier Division?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:45.120
You may be immature,
but this is hardly a difficult errand.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:46.330
Understood.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:54.910
And now I request you, Prinz Eugen,
famed warrior of Iron Blood.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:57.330
The 5th Carrier Division found some leftovers.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:58.950
There's no reason to let them go.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:04.120
I am ashamed to admit,
I worry deeply about my juniors.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:09.750
If Iron Blood forces were to lend us aid,
it would be most reassuring.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:15.660
Fine, I suppose.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:21.910
I'm taking Z23 and that
Ayanami girl from your camp.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.120
Yes, we would be honored
to witness a display of your strength.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:33.450
Ayanami.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:39.330
"Destroyer <i>Z23</i> "

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:37.450
Z23.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.330
We have a mission.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.790
Please follow us.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.540
Another battle...

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:46.870
Yes. An enemy fleet that
was away from the base.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.700
We will strike them before
they return to base.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:50.870
The enemy...

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:57.700
I don't dislike fighting.
But I don't like it either.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:00.410
Please don't be so selfish all of a sudden!

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:02.870
Z23, do you like fighting?

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:10.870
What we like is not relevant.
Our duty is to execute our mission.

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:19.500
We are ships. We were born to fight.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.160
I don't fully understand.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.250
I wonder if she's doing well.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:40.950
Hmm? Oh, that girl, Ayanami.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.790
Ayanami, right.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.580
Do we have to fight her?

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:56.700
That bird...

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.080
Enterprise!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:16.080
Enterprise, would you like a bite?

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.910
No, thanks.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:22.540
Enterprise, are you hurt?

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:27.540
Can you tell? It seems
my healing has slowed down.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.700
What?! You have to heal properly!

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:34.370
The critical repairs have been completed.
There's nothing to worry about.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:39.330
Enterprise, the strongest Eagle Union ship...

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:43.200
Is this personality part of her strength?

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:48.290
Enterprise, why do you push yourself so far?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.660
You ask a strange question.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:13:01.540
The purpose of our existence is to fight.
There is no doubt there.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:05.500
But Laffey doesn't want to work when sleepy.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:07.160
L-Laffey?!

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:13.370
But Laffey doesn't like it
when people pick on Laffey's friends.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:16.750
When that happens,
Laffey will work a bit harder.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:19.250
What about you, Enterprise?

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:22.000
I...

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.160
"Waters adjacent to
Azur Lane base"

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.750
"Heavy Cruiser <i>Northampton</i> "

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.750
Hammann, calm down.

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.660
"Destroyer <i>Hammann</i> "

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:33.790
This is no time to relax!
Hammann's base is in danger!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.700
"Light Cruiser <i>Helena</i> "

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:38.450
Um, like I said, the base told us
the enemies have already been repelled--

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:42.040
We have to hurry!

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:45.620
How energetic. She's been
like that since yesterday.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:48.580
"Light Aircraft Carrier <i>Long Island</i> "

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:48.580
This ghost is exhausted...

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.790
This ghost is exhausted...

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:52.750
"Battleship <i>Arizona</i> "

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:55.040
It seems like the famous Enterprise
was the one that beat back the enemy.

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:59.830
Enterprise...? Hornet, isn't that your...?

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:03.910
Yeah, it's quite a burden,
having such a champion as a big sister.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:03.910
"Aircraft Carrier <i>Hornet</i> "

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:09.660
What's with the lazy chit-chat?!
The enemy could come at any moment!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:14.580
Hammann does have a point.
It would be best if we hurried along.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:18.500
Everyone!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.700
Helena?

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:24.080
I guess we were a bit too slow.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.120
Sakura Empire 5th Carrier Division...

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.700
Oh... They look strong.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:37.370
Two-bit goons. Hammann will beat them up!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:48.410
Oh, poor me, bullied by those mean <i>senpais</i> ...

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.660
"Aircraft Carrier <i>Shoukaku</i> "

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.790
Don't you think so, Zuikaku?

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.290
C'mon, Big Sis, can you take this seriously?

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:03.790
This is our chance to make the 1st Carrier
Division elders see how strong we are.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:08.200
Oh, Zuikaku, you're such
a straightforward girl.

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:12.290
Don't worry, Zuikaku. Big Sis has your back!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:16.410
That's right! As long as you're with me,
I have nothing to fear!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:20.410
We have to go help Hornet and the others.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.160
Which ship is ready to move?

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.370
Wales!

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:26.000
Enterprise, she...

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.120
What...?

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:33.250
Enterprise! You're going too far ahead!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.120
There's no time to waste!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.870
You're still severely damaged!

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.950
You're just being reckless!

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:48.000
Hornet is my sister.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.290
Enterprise...

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:55.250
So you do have a human side after all.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.200
Oh, well. I guess I have to help you now.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.620
I have many sisters, too. I know how you feel.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:06.200
I just wish we had some escort vessels...

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.830
Laffey will go, too.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.580
Let's go help the others!

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.040
Okay!

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:35.700
This melody is a requiem, to quell the dead.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:49.200
I don't enjoy being totally on the defensive!

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:54.750
Gotcha!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:59.250
Dammit!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:04.580
What?!

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:12.250
Sister!

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.290
Go!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.750
Thanks, Sister!

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.500
There you are, Grey Ghost!

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.910
Eagle Union's strongest carrier, Enterprise!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.120
A worthy opponent!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:41.540
Brace yourself--this is a duel!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:49.540
Hornet! We're here to help!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:52.660
Nice timing. It was seriously
getting close there.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.080
Whoa.

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:59.790
This is our chance to pull back.
Let me just bring out my ship.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.040
<i>Feuer!</i>

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:16.290
Now what?!

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:21.160
<i>Guten tag.</i> Don't leave us
out of the fun, Azur Lane.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.160
You're Iron Blood...

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:32.250
Z23, can you take it from here?

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:42.830
I am Z23, Iron Blood destroyer.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:45.080
You will be defeated here.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.040
Oh, Ayanami...

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:56.370
Take the others and retreat.

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:57.790
Laffey?!

00:18:57.790 --> 00:19:00.700
You are volunteering to be the breach.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.120
An honorable act, even by an enemy.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:06.540
U- <i>chan</i> ...?

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.250
This is Azur Lane base command.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.700
It's been too long, Wales.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:14.830
Your Majesty!

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:20.290
Your wait is over. I, Queen Elizabeth,
and my noble fleet have arrived.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:19.080
"Battleship <i>Queen Elizabeth</i> "

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:27.950
Thank you, Your Majesty.
Our allies are under attack.

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.200
I am aware, of course.

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.410
I have already made my move.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:46.000
Not on my watch!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.200
Plenty more where that came from!

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.700
Is that all you've got, Grey Ghost?!

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:01.830
This is over!

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:04.370
No, Zuikaku!

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:20.580
This is madness!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.450
Unbelievable!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:45.250
Do we have to fight?

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:48.250
Oh, she's conflicted. How cute.

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:51.370
Let's see how this will play out.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.540
Wait, what?

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:58.000
Wh-What are you doing?

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:02.450
Actually, too sleepy. Time to quit.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:06.870
A-Are you toying with me?!
Take this seriously!

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:19.870
Zuikaku!

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.910
I must land at least one blow...

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:30.910
It's over.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:42.160
Of all moments, this is the one
where I reach my limit?

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:08.830
I've got you!

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:10.290
Excuse my interruption.

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:19.910
Who... Who the heck are you?!

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:24.580
Just a maid, passing by.

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.080
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
